    <h1>Branch Protection Coverage</h1>

<ul class="breadcrumb">
    <li><a href=".">Dashboard</a></li>
    <li>Branch Protection</li>
</ul>

<p class="meta">The 1 of 1 repositories
    (60.0% (3/5)) behind the Branch Protection card for
    <code>TestOrg</code>. The population considered is
    every non-archived repository; the table below is exactly the denominator that
    percentage is computed over, so the page and the card cannot disagree.</p>

<section class="card">
    <h2>In the denominator (1)</h2>
    
    <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table class="data-table" data-sortable>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col" data-sort-type="text">Repository <span class="tooltip-trigger tooltip-trigger-header" tabindex="0" data-tooltip="Repository name; links to it on GitHub when a URL is known.">ⓘ<span class="sr-only">Repository name; links to it on GitHub when a URL is known.</span></span></th>
                    <th scope="col" data-sort-type="text">Visibility <span class="tooltip-trigger tooltip-trigger-header" tabindex="0" data-tooltip="The repository&#39;s GitHub visibility: Public, Internal, or Private.">ⓘ<span class="sr-only">The repository&#39;s GitHub visibility: Public, Internal, or Private.</span></span></th>
                    <th scope="col" data-sort-type="text">Archived <span class="tooltip-trigger tooltip-trigger-header" tabindex="0" data-tooltip="Whether the repository is archived on GitHub.">ⓘ<span class="sr-only">Whether the repository is archived on GitHub.</span></span></th>
                    <th scope="col" data-sort-type="text">Verdict <span class="tooltip-trigger tooltip-trigger-header" tabindex="0" data-tooltip="Met counts toward the card&#39;s numerator; Not met counts only toward its denominator.">ⓘ<span class="sr-only">Met counts toward the card&#39;s numerator; Not met counts only toward its denominator.</span></span></th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                
                <tr data-denominator-row data-repo="repo-1">
                    <td><a href="https://github.com/TestOrg/repo-1"
                            target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">repo-1</a></td>
                    <td>Public</td>
                    <td>No</td>
                    <td class="status-pass">Met</td>
                </tr>
                
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    
</section>

<section class="card">
    <h2>Not measured — outside the denominator (0)</h2>
    <p class="meta">These repositories are in the population but the control could not be measured on
        them. They are excluded from both the numerator and the denominator: not measured is not the
        same finding as not compliant, and neither the card nor this page treats them as failing.</p>
    
    <p class="meta">Every repository in the population was measured.</p>
    
</section>

</body>

</html>
